# Never commit real values (SE-8). Full list in docs/LLD.md §15.2.
#
# Local development: `npx convex dev` writes CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT and CONVEX_URL
# to .env.local on first run, and nuxt.config.ts reads CONVEX_URL from there.
#
# Netlify: the build sets NUXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL via `convex deploy`.
NUXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
